OL,3,ALegendary Star Trek actor Sir Patrick
OL,4,AStewart dies aged 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FLegendary Star Trek actor Sir Patrick
OL,7,FStewart has died aged 86
OL,9,FHis co-stars have led tributes, with
OL,10,FWilliam Shatner saying that Stewart
OL,11,F"stood for the best of us"
OL,13,FMeanwhile, actor Hugh Jackman says "we
OL,14,Flost one of the greats of stage and
OL,15,Fscreen"
OL,17,FThe Royal Shakespeare Company describes
OL,18,Fthe actor as a "colossus" and flowers
OL,19,Fare due to be placed on his star on the
OL,20,FHollywood Walk of Fame
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
